  "details": "This is requesting the developers of VRChat to work with the creator of standable on steam. standable is a tracking system known as full body estimation, and it can deliver more fluent, and realistic movements for vrchat's default IK/tracking system for quest users, and PC users. If you guys were to work with him and to get into contact with each other, you guys could implement his code for full body estimation into the tracking system of VRchat, so that way users can have a better overall experience with VRChat, as well as I believe it will bring more people into the game, for it would be a fun feature to have at our hand. VRChat developers, please get into contact with l3lamas so that way if y'all decide to implement this code into your games development, it can be more fun and enjoyable, also he said himself that he is trying to see if y'all can work with him to implement his system for standable into VRChat",
